{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 12 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">去噪与图像恢复：残差、盲点与长程建模的假设边界</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Denoising &amp; Restoration</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_115_swinir-title\">SwinIR</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">SwinIR 把多个带卷积残差的 RSTB 置于浅层卷积和任务重建头之间，以移窗注意力服务高分辨率恢复。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Sandwiches multiple Residual Swin Transformer Blocks (RSTBs, each ending in a 3×3 convolutional residual) between a shallow CNN extractor and a reconstruction head.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">低分辨率、含噪或受压缩伪影影响的图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Low-resolution, noisy, or artifact-corrupted image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">超分、去噪或 JPEG artifact reduction 后的图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Super-resolved, denoised, or artifact-restored high-resolution image</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2021W/AIM/html/Liang_SwinIR_Image_Restoration_Using_Swin_Transformer_ICCVW_2021_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_115_swinir')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_115_swinir')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"SwinIR original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/724befd52855cf81a64e.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 7 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_115_swinir', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_115_swinir\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_115_swinir')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_115_swinir', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_115_swinir\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">退化图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">任务不同但共享主干接口</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests low-resolution, noisy, or artifact-corrupted image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"任务不同但共享主干接口\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests low-resolution, noisy, or artifact-corrupted image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"退化图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_115_swinir', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">退化图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">任务不同但共享主干接口</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests low-resolution, noisy, or artifact-corrupted image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"提取低频基础特征并建立长残差支路\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Shallow Conv to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Shallow Conv\" data-node-name-en=\"Shallow Conv\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_115_swinir', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Shallow Conv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">提取低频基础特征并建立长残差支路</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Shallow Conv to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个 RSTB 含多层 shifted-window attention、MLP 与块内卷积残差\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Residual Swin Transformer Blocks within the core residual swin transformer restoration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Residual Swin Transformer Blocks\" data-node-name-en=\"Residual Swin Transformer Blocks\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_115_swinir', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Residual Swin Transformer Blocks</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个 RSTB 含多层 shifted-window attention、MLP 与块内卷积残差</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Residual Swin Transformer Blocks within the core residual swin transformer restoration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"窗口内建模，交替移窗让相邻窗口通信\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Window/shifted-window attention within the core residual swin transformer restoration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Window/shifted-window attention\" data-node-name-en=\"Window/shifted-window attention\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_115_swinir', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Window/shifted-window attention</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">窗口内建模，交替移窗让相邻窗口通信</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Window/shifted-window attention within the core residual swin transformer restoration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多个 RSTB 后卷积并与浅层特征相加\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Deep feature fusion within the core residual swin transformer restoration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Deep feature fusion\" data-node-name-en=\"Deep feature fusion\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_115_swinir', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Deep feature fusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多个 RSTB 后卷积并与浅层特征相加</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Deep feature fusion within the core residual swin transformer restoration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"超分用 pixel-shuffle/上采样；去噪与去伪影用卷积输出\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies reconstruction head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"任务特定重建 head\" data-node-name-en=\"reconstruction head\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_115_swinir', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务特定重建 head</span><span class=\"lang-en\">reconstruction head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">超分用 pixel-shuffle/上采样；去噪与去伪影用卷积输出</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies reconstruction head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"与输入同尺寸或按设定倍率放大\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces super-resolved, denoised, or artifact-restored high-resolution image via Stage 07.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"恢复图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 07\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_115_swinir', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">恢复图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 07</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">与输入同尺寸或按设定倍率放大</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces super-resolved, denoised, or artifact-restored high-resolution image via Stage 07.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"SwinIR Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 残差 Swin Transformer 块的深浅特征融合</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Residual Swin Transformer Block (RSTB) Combining Shifted-Window Attention &amp; Conv Inductive Bias</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"SwinIR：核心公式 · 残差 Swin Transformer 块的深浅特征融合\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"115\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"10.183193pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.642889 -69.079189 217.704817 10.183193\" width=\"217.704817pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M1.934564-.746293L1.825881-.825994C1.48534-.412997 1.304201-.26084 1.166535-.26084C1.094079-.26084 1.028869-.311559 1.021624-.369524C1.021624-.485452 1.101325-.702819 1.144798-.84773L1.731689-3.180801L1.775162-3.195292C.920186-3.057626 .746293-3.035889 .412997-3.014153V-2.898224C.862222-2.890978 .927432-2.869242 .934677-2.72433C.934677-2.666366 .91294-2.543191 .876713-2.405526L.550663-1.123062C.434734-.688328 .39126-.478207 .39126-.333296C.405751-.06521 .543417 .079701 .789766 .079701C1.188272 .079701 1.48534-.137666 1.934564-.746293ZM2.151931-4.267635C2.144686-4.477756 1.956301-4.658895 1.731689-4.658895S1.340429-4.499492 1.347674-4.27488C1.35492-4.043022 1.528813-3.890865 1.767917-3.890865C1.985283-3.890865 2.159177-4.064759 2.151931-4.267635Z\" id=\"m115_g10-56\"></path><path d=\"M6.084282-4.96271L6.401896-6.481299H1.459037V-6.322492C2.114114-6.26294 2.223294-6.203387 2.223294-5.925476C2.223294-5.766669 2.183592-5.528459 2.114114-5.280323L.893288-.893288C.71463-.297763 .645152-.23821 .079403-.158807V0H2.580609V-.158807C2.004935-.188583 1.826277-.297763 1.826277-.595525C1.826277-.684854 1.846128-.803959 1.915606-1.042169L2.530982-3.255538C2.898223-3.235687 3.116582-3.225761 3.33